{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987610-interesting-improvised-weapons","id":987610,"title":"Interesting Improvised Weapons.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-14T22:04:01-07:00","id":987610,"title":"Interesting Improvised Weapons.","content":"Hi everyone.<br /> <br /> Was just wondering what the most interesting improvised weapons you have seen used in your games. I was recently creating an antagonist that would occassionally tear a street sign out of the ground to use it as a weapon and got thinking about what else people have thought up on the fly. <br /> <br /> Any and all are welcome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3268-krzyzstof","name":"Krzyzstof","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3268_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T22:28:17-07:00","id":987620,"title":"","content":"A Promethean of mine (Tammuz on the Refinement of Ferrum) once used a Stigmatic as a club against another Stigmatic thanks to the Unconquered Alembic.<br /> <br /> It... was a weird plot moment. We were in a condo that was waking up and trying to eat us. The God-Machine was trying to turn it into a Not!Anakim in an effort to infiltrate the Primordial Dream for nefarious purposes we never fully understood because the game eventually stalled out. I'm glad to say said game involved two Beasts, myself, the Promethean, a vampire, and three Unchained. Other fun moments involved the corporeal form of an Angel getting splattered by giant shards of falling glass thanks to one of our Beasts turning an airport into a region of the Hedge. Cue a trio of Hunter-Angels showing up and making our lives difficult.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T03:32:54-07:00","id":987694,"title":"","content":"In a game I was STing there was two occasions were a Vade Mecum was used as weapon. An NPC first thought of it, but eventualy a PC wanted to even reinforce the book for effectiveness as weapon...<br /> <br /> At another one, as a player, I saw a werewolf being almost killed by an old lady with an umbrella. I should note that the werewolf didn't defended, but still...<br /> <br /> People already tried in my games to defend themselves with things like wheels or mucus, but not to the same degree of violence used above.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T04:43:59-07:00","id":988785,"title":"","content":"I'm fond of nail guns. Much fun when an invisible or super fast guy can nail an opponent's feet to the floor as the opening move.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10978-azenogoth","name":"Azenogoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10978_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T05:37:53-07:00","id":988807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Azenogoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987610-interesting-improvised-weapons?p=988785#post988785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm fond of nail guns. Much fun when an invisible or super fast guy can nail an opponent's feet to the floor as the opening move.</div> </div> </div> </div>But should those not work as Firearms weapons?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T12:05:19-07:00","id":988967,"title":"","content":"It may use the firearms skill, but if I were ST, I would certainly rule is as an improvised weapon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10978-azenogoth","name":"Azenogoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10978_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T12:45:40-07:00","id":988983,"title":"","content":"I was in a game where a couple of mortals used a pool table to push a few zombies back outside a broken door and reseal it. It ended up buying over an hour of valuable time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T03:44:14-07:00","id":989280,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/987610-interesting-improvised-weapons?p=987620#post987620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Promethean of mine (Tammuz on the Refinement of Ferrum) once used a Stigmatic as a club against another Stigmatic thanks to the Unconquered Alembic</div> </div> </div> </div>Hitting a guy with another guy is a personal favourite of mine, too.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T11:39:37-07:00","id":989462,"title":"","content":"My Julii beat the ghost of a Roman emperor to death with the red sandals of Caligula, his bane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10827-baronzobops","name":"baronzobops","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10827_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T16:22:13-07:00","id":989605,"title":"","content":"I don't think bane-using is precisely in the mood of the topic, since it is meant to be used, even if being an improvised weapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}